    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d541-a1">

                <pb facs="0548" n="1282" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1282"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation of
                    telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vali of Adana to Sublime Forte.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-14"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi> 14,
                            1895</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The moutessarif of Mersine informs me that the American consulate has addressed a
                    letter expressing its thanks for the satisfactory settlement of the Christie
                    affair. Mr. Christie, accompanied by the dragoman, called upon the Imperial
                    authorities to express, on his own part, his thanks for the efforts made by them
                    to settle this matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Faïk.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
